(f)pass the licensing examination sequence required by division rule made in collaboration with the board;
(g)be able to read, write, speak, understand, and be understood in the English language and demonstrate proficiency to the satisfaction of the board if requested by the board;
(h)meet with the board and representatives of the division, if requested, for the purpose of evaluating the applicant's qualifications for licensure;
(i)designate:
(i)a contact person for access to medical records in accordance with the federal Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act; and
